so raise concerns for crew cooperation. Then we can say that given the current evidence, Candidate C still appears strongest, but we need clarification on how C's communication difficulty manifests and whether egocentric style is mitigated by his concern for others. So we can ask Agent 1 for more detail on C's communication.\n\nThus public message: share observations about A and B, note D's interpersonal concerns from Agent 2, and request more detail on C's communication from Agent 1. Vote: Candidate C provisional.\n\nLet's craft."}
